WEBVTT

00:00:27.499 --> 00:00:31.919
We're all going to conduct
a piece of Strauss together.

00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:34.480
Alright? And you all know it.

00:00:34.815 --> 00:00:36.377
Alright. Are you ready?

00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:37.562
Audience: Yeah!

00:00:37.586 --> 00:00:39.888
Beau Lotto: Alright.
Ready, one, two, three!

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:41.704
It's just the end.

00:00:41.728 --> 00:00:45.697
(Music: Richard Strauss
"Also Sprach Zarathustra")

00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:50.211
Right?

00:00:50.235 --> 00:00:51.729
You know where it's going.

00:00:51.753 --> 00:00:56.871
(Music)